  inspect the project spawn policy: spawn.enabled can disable all child runs and
  per-agent model_criterion=equal pins the executable model without model ranking;
  ordered criteria are intentionally fail-closed until provider-local ordering
  exists.
  Do not perform board task work inline unless the human explicitly asks for inline execution.
