- [Machine-readable manifest](/Users/iv/Developer/relux-tunnel/.research/260720_task-260715-28ok1k-ssh-engine-candidate-manifest.json)

Key findings:

- SwiftNIO SSH pinned to `0.14.1`; 16 MiB window and internal-only client rekey verified.
- libssh2 pinned to post-security-fix commit `a343024` with OpenSSL `3.5.7`; release `1.11.1` lacks six fixes.
- libssh2 exposes window control but also lacks public client rekey.
- ADR-014 remains open; symmetric rekey, scale, cancellation, Apple-build, and memory experiments are defined.

Hashes, JSON, release build, resource copies, and board structure were verified. Both outcomes are attached to the task and findings were recorded in `LOGBOOK.md`.
